From 9d7673fee01558e0fe2ec79ffd0058e590a2af54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kk <kaiwalyakhasnis57@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:28:44 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] recovery: add Road Fighter game to the Advanced menu

Port of https://github.com/kaiwalyakhasnis/Road-Fighter-Compose to
recovery's minui: same rules (road 1:2.5:0.5, 20dp steps, collisions,
score per passed car, level every 25 points with faster road and tinted
verges), composed in a private RGBA buffer with clipping and alpha and
pushed with one gr_blit()/gr_flip() per frame.

- roadfighter/: game code, assets (road PNGs from the app, car vector
  drawables rasterized with tools/vec2png.py), installed at
  /etc/roadfighter in the recovery ramdisk (res/* is wiped by the
  recovery image build).
- RecoveryUI::PollInputEvent(): non-blocking event read for the game loop.
- Advanced menu: "Play Road Fighter".

Controls: Left/Right or Volume Up/Down or tap a screen half to steer;
Power/Enter/tap to play again; Back/Esc (or a volume key on the game
over screen) to exit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I4014aa54a5cf8cb4c574e04d7820058de218d593
---
